{c: Verse}

[G]Meri [Cm]kismat ke har ek panne pe

mere [Fm]jeete ji baad marne ke

mere [G]har ek kal.. Har ek [Cm]lamhe mein

tu [A#]likh de [G#]mera [G]usey

[G]har [Cm]kahani mein saare kisson mein

dil ki [Fm]duniya ke sacche rishton mein

zinda [G]gani ke saare [Cm]hisson mey

tu [A#]likh de [G#]mera [G]usey

{c: Chorus}

[G] aye [Cm]khuda aye [A#]khuda

jab [G#]bana uska hi [G]bana-[2 times]

{c: Bridge}

[Cm]uska hoon us [Fm]mein hoon usse hoon usi [Gm]ka rehne [Cm]de

[Cm]main toh pyasa hoon hai [Fm]dariya wo zariya woh [Gm]jeene ka [Cm]Mere

[Cm]Mujhe ghar de [Fm]gali de shehar de [Gm]usi ke naam [Cm]ke

[Cm]kadam yeh chalen ya [Fm]ruken ab [Gm]usi ke vaas [Cm]tey

